  "solution": "Given: × = + , + = − , − = × , / = ÷\n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\n**Option 1) 10 × 2 + 4 – 1 = 21**\n\nAfter replacing signs:\n\n⇒ 10 + 2 − **4 × 1 **= 21\n\n⇒ **10 + 2 **−** **4** **= 21\n\n⇒ **12 − 4 **= 21\n\n⇒ 8 ≠ 21\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 2) 8 – 2 × 3 + 1 = 15**\n\nAfter replacing signs:\n\n⇒ 8 × 2 + 3 − 1 = 15\n\n⇒ **16** + 3 − 1 = 15\n\n⇒ **19 − 1 **= 15\n\n⇒ 18 ≠ 15\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 3) 12 + 6 – 2 × 2 = 28**\n\nAfter replacing signs:\n\n⇒ 12 −** 6 × 2 **+ 2 = 28\n\n⇒ 12 −** 12 + 2 **= 28\n\n⇒** 12 − 10 **= 28\n\n⇒ 2 ≠ 28\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 4) 14 – 3 + 5 × 2 = 39**\n\nAfter replacing signs:\n\n⇒ **14 × 3 **− 5 + 2 = 39\n\n⇒** **42** **− **5 + 2 **= 39\n\n⇒ **42 − 3** = 39\n\n⇒ **39 = 39** \n\n⇒ LHS = RHS \n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 4\"**.",
